bind Prepare Sample: Sample ID
bind Measure Hardness: Hardness Value, Sample ID
bind Conduct Tensile Test: Tensile Strength, Sample ID
bind Evaluate Corrosion Resistance: Corrosion Resistance, Sample ID
bind Perform Thermal Analysis: Thermal Conductivity, Sample ID
bind Analyze Microstructure: Microstructure Type, Sample ID
bind Conduct X-ray Diffraction: X-ray Intensity, Sample ID
bind Perform Chemical Analysis: Chemical Purity, Sample ID
bind Calibrate Equipment: Equipment Status
bind Approve Material: Approval Status, Sample ID
bind Reject Material: Sample ID
Sample ID: integer between 1 and 1000
Hardness Value: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Tensile Strength: float between 0.0 and 2000.0
Corrosion Resistance: High, Medium, Low
Thermal Conductivity: float between 0.0 and 500.0
Microstructure Type: Grain, Fiber, Amorphous
X-ray Intensity: integer between 0 and 10000
Chemical Purity: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Equipment Status: Calibrated, Not Calibrated
Approval Status: Approved, Rejected, Pending
